# S4 acceptance transcript: modules and names.
#
# S3 |- S4. Until here a module is closed: every name it uses, it declares.
# S4 lets one module refer to another, and decides what can then go wrong.

$ foundation verify --dir foundations/S4
> foundation S4
> digest 8d4ff95207a5988e9f2893ef5f9b24822bf8093858bd996d43f1a4e7032ef348
> closure 119 artifacts
